       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRINGOPS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FIRST PIC X(10) VALUE 'SANJAY'.
       01 WS-LAST PIC X(10) VALUE 'KUMAR'.
       01 WS-FULL PIC X(25).
       01 WS-WORD1 PIC X(10).
       01 WS-WORD2 PIC X(10).
       01 WS-SENTENCE PIC X(40) VALUE 'SANJAY KUMAR MAINFRAME DEV'.
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 99.
       01 WS-CHAR PIC X VALUE 'A'.
       01 WS-POS PIC 99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           STRING WS-FIRST DELIMITED BY SIZE
                   WS-LAST DELIMITED BY SIZE
                   INTO WS-FULL.
           DISPLAY WS-FULL.

           UNSTRING WS-SENTENCE
               DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO WS-WORD1 WS-WORD2.
           DISPLAY WS-WORD1.
           DISPLAY WS-WORD2.

           INSPECT WS-SENTENCE TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR CHARACTERS.
           DISPLAY WS-COUNT.

           INSPECT WS-SENTENCE TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL 'A'.
           DISPLAY WS-COUNT.

           INSPECT WS-FIRST TALLYING WS-POS FOR CHARACTERS
               BEFORE INITIAL 'J'.
           DISPLAY WS-POS.
           STOP RUN.
